   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "Captain, space transfer to L2 complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Deviation from the planned exit point?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Minus 002.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "That's smaller than last time. Then continue inertial@navigation and inspect the space transfer device.@The next one is long-range, so be thorough.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Bryan",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Hmm... So the space transfer itself@really is instantaneous.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "That's correct, Envoy Midcrid.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "I feel like I understand why the Zovorg try to@expand their territory in space, not just in my head,@but in my body too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "That was a valuable experience.@As a politician, I'd never get the chance@otherwise. Thank you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Now then, Envoy, please return to your quarters.@Normally...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "The crew mustn't know I'm here yet.@I understand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Eun",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "(So that's what this was about after all.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "I got to see our lovely captain's command style@again, so I'll make myself scarce.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Thank you for understanding.@Tonight's dinner will be in the commander's office.@The captain and I will join you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Personally, I'd prefer it just be the captain and me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Pardon?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Envoy, that's...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "I'm joking, joking.@Well, I wish you a safe voyage to our destination.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Attention, bridge crew. As I told you before transfer,@Envoy Bryan Midcrid's presence aboard is top@secret until further notice.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "(An envoy... Why would the former President,@Mr. Midcrid, be here?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "(This mission... Any way you look at it,@it's no trial voyage.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Now, Commander.@To Briefing Room 1, please.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Mm.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Can't believe we're already out in space.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "That was kind of anticlimactic.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "It doesn't feel like you're in space@unless you break free of gravity?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "But it's nice that it saves time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "True. Space transfer's a pain when the enemy uses it,@but it's convenient when we use it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "But hey, this is a long-range transfer test,@so why go up to orbit first?@Why not just go straight to Mars?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "To do a space transfer, you need to observe the@destination and secure space there. If there's a@massive object, you risk fusing with it...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "It's also best to observe the gravity balance in@advance. And for that, satellite orbit is better@than the surface.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "...I mean, it was in the written orders.@Didn't you read them?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Come on, they told us to load our units in@about half the usual time.@I didn't have time to read stuff carefully.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "True, rushing out here with the full roster@just for a trial voyage is pretty weird.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "With the <Cross Gate Burst> and everything, things@are fishy. Why are we leaving the Earth Sphere?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Maybe there's a big mess waiting where we're going.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "I'm not surprised. I figured they fitted the Hiryu@Custom with a space transfer device to make it@easier to send into hot zones or enemy cores.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "And if anything does happen, we can get back fast.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "No, no, you can't talk like it's someone else's problem...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Everyone, please take your seats.@We'll now begin the briefing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "I'll explain the outline of the interplanetary long-range@transfer test voyage, but first there's someone to@introduce. The SRX and PTX Teams haven't met her yet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Lieutenant, introduce yourself.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Yes, sir. I am Gayattoba Stecca...@aide to the <Zovorg> Privy Council's envoy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "For certain reasons, I hold a commission in the@Earth Federation Army, and I also have an Earth@name, Yon Gebana.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "(The <Privy Council> envoy... That's Mekibos.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "(I'd heard about her, but... she's cute.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Lieutenant Yon is also an observer for operating@the space transfer device brought from the Zovorg.@She'll explain this test voyage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "As stated in the materials you received in advance,@observing the destination is essential for@a safe space transfer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "However, if information on already-observed@relay points has been accumulated,@observation can be skipped.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "The Zovorg call routes linking these relay points@\"Transition Routes.\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "We have built several Transition Routes@to the solar system and the Earth Sphere...@This time, we will use one of them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Currently, the Zovorg Privy Council forbids@interference in the Earth Sphere. Combat using@mobile weapons should be out of the question, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Most regrettably, as you all know, there are@those who defy the Privy Council's decisions.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Therefore, we're likely to encounter \"enemies\"@at the Transition Route's relay points.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "So, anticipating attack, all further space transfers@will be made with all hands at Level 1 battle stations,@and we'll deploy an energy field right after transfer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "(That's not anticipating it. That's a posture@that treats it as a given.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Captain, I have a question. May I?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Of course. Go ahead.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "The risk of attack comes from using existing@Transition Routes. Couldn't we find our own relay@points and transfer using those?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "That's...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "I cannot answer that question.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "(So there's some reason they need to hurry...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "I have a question too.@Ah, not for the captain, for Lieutenant Yon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "What is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Do you have any idea who the enemy is?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "For anyone to defy the Privy Council's will and act@militarily in the Earth Sphere, the most likely@candidate would be the Golaikunru.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "They're the Zovorg war merchants who worked with@<Zezenan> in <The Sealing War>, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Yes, sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "And why would they break the ban and come to Earth?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "...Their objective is unknown at this time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Listen. Our unit's mission is to gather@long-range transfer data as quickly as possible@and build up a track record.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "I want you pilots to focus on keeping@the Hiryu Custom safe in the process.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "(The brass is definitely hiding something...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "(This test voyage won't go smoothly, I bet.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "The space transfer experiment begins at 1600.@All pilots, stand by at Level 1 battle stations@from 1520.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Commander, it's almost 1600.@Shall I begin the space transfer sequence?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Then, space transfer sequence,@first phase...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Contact on radar!@Unknowns approaching straight in from 2 o'clock,@10 degrees above! Range 3!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Continue the space transfer sequence!@All mobile units, launch immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Tch, so Lieutenant Yon's prediction came true already!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Unknowns identified!@They're mass-produced Canis!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Canis...@Those were <Gaia Savers> units, weren't they?@So there were remnants of them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "I'd thought it would be hard to arrest all the combat@personnel who weren't at <Grand Christmas>,@but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Even after their main force was dismantled,@they come after us in a place like this...@Is this meant as revenge?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "What concerns me is who's aboard the Canis.@According to Lieutenant Ing Wish, they were@piloted by <Machinery Children>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "With Arthur Steinbeck and Egret Fehu dead,@they're nothing more than stragglers.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "But that many of them... And if they're@Machinery Children, wouldn't they need a proper@base or mothership?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Prying into that is not our mission.@Our top priority is the space transition@to the second relay point.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "If we're delayed at all, it'll be a serious problem.@I won't be able to explain myself to the Joint@Chiefs of Staff either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Don't forget the great responsibility we bear.@This ship must not take any damage.@Eliminate the enemy as quickly as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Understood, Commander.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Spiria 0 to all units. The Hiryu can't move@until the space transition sequence's Fourth@Phase is complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Fast units, move forward and intercept.@Slower units, stay back and cover the ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "But be back aboard within 300 seconds.@Otherwise, you'll be left behind here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "So, don't go in too deep, huh?@Kyosuke, no charging in too far, okay?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Well, if you do get left behind,@I'll keep you company.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "I have no intention of going on a spacewalk@with you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Aw, shucks.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Ibis, with the Hyperlion's speed, you can hold out@until the last second. But don't disgrace yourself@by getting left behind.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "I know.@Tsugumi, calculate the cutoff line for returning...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Tsugumi",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Already done.@I'll put it up on your monitor.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "(If they timed their attack@for our space transition...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Don't overdo it, Yon.@You're supposed to be an observer, after all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Please, don't worry about me.@My master ordered me to cooperate@as much as I can.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "(...Are those Canis being piloted@by surviving Machinery Children?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "(But this odd feeling...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "All units, spread out!@Don't let the enemy near the Hiryu!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Captain, that last attack caused@a problem with the space transition device.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Then our mission...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Dragon 2 to all units!@180 seconds until the Fourth Phase of the ship's@space transition sequence is complete!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Dragon 2 to all units!@120 seconds until the Fourth Phase is complete!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Dragon 2 to all units!@60 seconds until the Fourth Phase is complete!@Return to the ship immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Captain, we can't recover the units in time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "It can't be helped.@Have them latch on to the ship somehow...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Report from the engine room!@There's a malfunction in the space transition device!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "What?!@Then we can't carry out our mission!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the combat area are gone.@No enemies within search range.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "All units, return to the ship at once.@After the Fourth Phase, we'll move to the Final@Phase and transition to the second relay point.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "Captain, all units have been recovered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "30 seconds until the Fourth Phase of the space@transition sequence is complete!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Fire short-range SAMs at the remaining enemies.@Then deploy the energy field at maximum output.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Roger.@After firing short-range SAMs, deploying the@energy field at maximum output.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "Attention, all hands. After the Fourth Phase,@we'll immediately move to the Final Phase and@make the space transition to the second relay point.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}